# L §2.3 Calls (round 14): a band's id "with the prefixes that name the band outside ... its base: household.b(x) in a
# scenario's expression row (§6.4)". L6_4_expression_row_reads.test's s3 with the band written household.fee: fee's one
# row gives 10 PLN.
=== household.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2040-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
input cap: num PLN
input day0: date
band fee(x: num PLN): num PLN

def held: num PLN
  rule r = bal(konto, day0)

version base_2026
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  cap = 1 000.00 PLN "own"
  day0 = 2026-06-30 "own"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  fee: [0 PLN, inf) = 10.00 PLN "own"

ask c: cap law 2031-06-30
=== s3.tally
scenario s3 over household
  tally 2
  from 2031-01-01

version v3
  cite plan
  governs 2031-01-01..
  known 2026-10-20
  replace cap = household.fee(household.cap) "z pasma"

ask a: cap in s3 law 2031-06-30
=== expect
a: 10 PLN
  world: s3
...
